&nbsp; With what little strength Shiva had, she carried her children to Shar Vahl where her best friend Pinkkitty a berserker would protect them til they were old enough to go to mines of gloomingdeep where their training would begin.&nbsp; Iffrit and his siblings all went their own ways when they entered the mines.&nbsp; As time went on he lost much contact with his siblings.&nbsp; When he entered his hometown of Ak'Anon he found Pinkkitty waiting their telling him how much he has learned in his childhood.&nbsp; She said that the best class that would suit him would be an enchanter for he was good at mind games and liked to control inanimate objects.&nbsp; Iffrit was soon invited to the family of Binded Souls where he met his new friends Rikov and Amyana.&nbsp; Gonadgar also watched over him as it was his first time being in a family that has large like his own.&nbsp; Afterwards Amyana let him join the Moonlite Redemption where he made new friends and is still in the big family.&nbsp; Iffrit is always wanting to help the best he can and still in training of the enchanter life, he hopes to prove to his new family that he can acheive anything he puts his mind too.</span></font></span></p>
							
